        <span itemprop="definition">was extrusion-cast onto a chill roll controlled so as to have a surface temperature of 25° C., through a T-die to obtain a gel sheet of 2100  ⁇ m in thickness.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0126">
